      "content": "\n\n<columns>\n\n\n[Apparently real](https://www.washingtonpost.com/history/2019/12/22/they-will-kill-santa-jfk-promised-rd-grader-that-kris-kringle-was-safe-russians/)\n\nI started with entering this image into Perplexity, then continuing to evolve the prompt & generate things from there.  — DAF 12/20/2024\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCultural - Military Typography — Typographic Warfare — [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suGhLij5](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suGhLij5) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\nContinue to develop the image prompt, with dialectic/dualistic relationship between traditional Russian Ded Moroz, and Grateful Dead American Uncle Sam [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suRfidAo](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suRfidAo).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n# CHESS\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</columns>\n\n",
